            "parallelValue": [],
            "groupedValue": [],
            "value": "Montoya, J. (2024). To What Extent Are Elementary Teachers Using Universal Design for Learning? Do These Strategies Improve Computational Thinking Scores?. Stanford Digital Repository. Available at https://purl.stanford.edu/px724hs2284. ",
